A massive biomechanical creature with glowing core, layered metallic plates shifting, movements both organic and mechanical
Charges through a city, smashing buildings, then reconfigures mid-motion into a faster, more aggressive form while attacking everything in its path
Dense urban environment collapsing under its weight, sparks, fire, debris everywhere
Shot 1 : wide aerial establishing scale, drone dive toward creature; 
Shot 2 : low tracking between its legs, camera shaking with each step; 
Shot 3 : crash zoom on transformation, mechanical parts shifting in sequence; 
Shot 4 : orbit shot as it destroys structures, debris flying toward lens

A lone hero standing still in a destroyed city, breathing heavy, body damaged but unyielding
Looks up as multiple explosions ignite around him in a perfect circular sequence, debris rising as if gravity is breaking
Urban ruins with fire, smoke, and particles suspended in air
- Slow push-in with subtle orbit; 
- Explosions triggering in sequence, debris lifting; 
Time dilation effect, particles frozen; 
Crash zoom into eyes as light overwhelms frame

A massive armored truck with aggressive design, engine roaring violently, reinforced plating reflecting fire
Smashes through a convoy while being chased, vehicles flipping and exploding as it forces its way forward
Desert highway with dust storms, wreckage scattering across road
Shot 1 (0–4s): aerial drone dive into chase; 
Shot 2 (4–8s): low tracking beside wheels crushing debris; 
Shot 3 (8–12s): whip pans to side explosions and collisions; 
Shot 4 (12–15s): frontal tracking as truck bursts through fire wall, sparks and debris slamming lens

A futuristic armored soldier with glowing visor and reactive exosuit, body stabilized by micro-movements, calm under pressure
Drops from the sky at extreme velocity, slams into the ground creating a shockwave that lifts enemies into the air, then launches forward with enhanced speed delivering rapid kinetic strikes
Sci-fi battlefield with metallic debris, drones flying, energy blasts crossing the air
Shot 1 (0–5s): Aerial drone dive following descent, clouds tearing apart, camera accelerating with him; Shot 2 (5–8s): Impact in slow motion, shockwave rippling ground outward, debris lifting; 
Shot 3 (8–12s): dynamic orbit as he engages enemies mid-air, whip pans connecting hits; 
Shot 4 (12–15s): forward tracking as he dashes through enemies in a blur, energy trails and sparks exploding outward

Epic cinematic Earth zoom-in sequence beginning from deep outer space. The shot opens with a wide, majestic view of planet Earth floating silently in the vast darkness (0–5s). The camera then rapidly accelerates forward, diving toward the planet at extreme speed, passing through glowing atmospheric layers, dense cloud formations, and sweeping continental views with intense motion blur, light trails, and fiery atmospheric entry effects (5–10s).

The descent continues as the camera moves over a devastated, post-apocalyptic city filled with collapsed skyscrapers, wild vegetation reclaiming streets, abandoned vehicles, broken highways, and drifting dust clouds. Without breaking the motion, it smoothly enters an enormous deserted structure and transitions into a hidden futuristic robotics workshop inside.

Inside the workshop, the space is packed with mechanical tools, scattered robot components, welding sparks flying, illuminated holographic interfaces, and heavy industrial metal textures. The continuous single-take camera movement gradually slows and settles into a clean medium shot of the main character @img1, who confidently poses with a playful finger-gun aimed toward the camera while giving a subtle wink. Her robot companion @img2 stands right beside her, integrated naturally into the scene.

@img1 serves as the primary character reference with accurate facial features, outfit, and pose consistency as the focal point of the workshop scene.
@img2 represents the robotic companion with precise design placement and detailed mechanical accuracy next to the main character.

Cinematic Hollywood-style grading with a muted, desaturated tone, cool teal-blue highlights, strong contrast, soft film grain, and floating dust particles in the air. Ultra-realistic yet stylized sci-fi aesthetic, highly detailed, 8K quality, masterpiece-level visual composition.

@image 1 is the main subject identity (female, silver hair, exact face, must remain 100% consistent across all frames, no variation)

@image 2 is the storyboard layout reference (12 panels, sequence, framing, timing must be followed precisely, no deviation)

@image Generate a 15-second cinematic video that strictly follows the storyboard sequence from @image 2 while using the subject from @image 1.

@image STYLE:
ultra realistic, photorealistic, cinematic lighting, physically accurate lighting, global illumination, volumetric fog, god rays, soft shadows, high dynamic range, realistic light falloff, subsurface scattering skin, skin pores, micro texture, cinematic lens 85

@image CONSISTENCY RULE:
same face, same proportions, same hair, no redesign, no stylization drift, no identity change
CAMERA:
cinematic movement, parallax depth, smooth tracking, whip pan for action, handheld micro shake, motion blur on impact

@image Micro details: cloth movement, hair physics, breathing motion, dust particles
cinematic timing: build → impact → silence
impact frames use slight slow motion + shake burst

